There's a whole list of things I do to get out quickly, most
of which are unnecessary. Light on the upstairs, paths dug,
rations by many downstairs, many c!oGL for the no teleport
levels, many ?oTeleport for the others, /oDeath for Rodney,
/oFire for the green slimes. As Phillip noted, do all your
housekeeping before you wake Rodney. Then get the book and
level teleport to the bottom.

